Object.assign(window.PlannerTranslations.de,{"GM workspace": "GM-Arbeitsbereich", "Compact GM controls": "Kompakte GM-Steuerung", "Asset drawer": "Ressourcenschublade", "Planned selection": "Geplante Auswahl", "Inspector": "Inspektor", "Editor": "Editor", "Review deployment": "Deployment prüfen", "Request results": "Anfrageergebnisse", "Offline rehearsal": "Offline-Probe", "Pause rehearsal": "Probe pausieren", "Advance rehearsal": "Probe fortsetzen", "Close asset drawer": "Ressourcenschublade schließen", "Close inspector": "Inspektor schließen", "Edit selection": "Auswahl bearbeiten", "Unit editor": "Einheiteneditor", "Workspace preference could not be saved": "Arbeitsbereichseinstellung konnte nicht gespeichert werden", "Planned markers are separate from live tracking and offline rehearsal. Editing opens the existing form.": "Geplante Marker sind von Live-Tracking und Offline-Probe getrennt. Bearbeiten öffnet das vorhandene Formular.", "Choose an asset, then use Unit editor to Apply changes or Place new unit. Browsing does not spawn entities.": "Ressource wählen, dann im Einheiteneditor Änderungen anwenden oder neue Einheit platzieren. Durchsuchen erzeugt keine Entitäten.", "selected planned objects": "ausgewählte geplante Objekte", "Unnamed planned object": "Unbenanntes geplantes Objekt", "Plan ID": "Plan-ID", "Object type": "Objekttyp", "Unit": "Einheit", "Route": "Route", "Area": "Bereich", "Locked": "Gesperrt", "Unlocked": "Entsperrt", "Asset": "Ressource", "Points": "Punkte", "Inspector shows up to 16 selected objects.": "Der Inspektor zeigt bis zu 16 ausgewählte Objekte.", "Enable compact GM workspace": "Kompakten GM-Arbeitsbereich aktivieren", "Off": "Aus", "Starting": "Startet", "Pairing": "Kopplung", "Waiting for data": "Wartet auf Daten", "Connecting": "Verbindet", "Connected": "Verbunden", "Receiving": "Empfängt", "Stale": "Veraltet", "Retrying": "Erneuter Versuch", "Expired": "Abgelaufen", "Authentication failed": "Authentifizierung fehlgeschlagen", "Security lockout": "Sicherheitssperre", "Unsupported": "Nicht unterstützt", "Interrupted": "Unterbrochen"});

window.PlannerTranslations.fr["Open the GM tab in the right panel. Import a mission first, then Create rehearsal from this plan or Load scenario JSON. Resume enables Advance 10 seconds; time does not run automatically. Fire enabled scenario events, inspect objectives and reports, and view purple rehearsal markers. Export journal saves the run separately from your mission. Load journal requires the same mission. The replay slider previews a command revision; Return to GM restores the active run. Undo GM action reverses the last command while retaining its history. Reset is recorded and starts a fresh state. Editing the mission unloads the rehearsal. Recover saved rehearsal offers the last valid run after reopening, against the same mission. Export journal remains a portable backup. These controls do not send commands to Reforger. GM workspace in the header enables the optional compact layout. Assets opens the existing searchable drawer; Inspector shows planned selection, ID, grid and GUID. Editor restores the existing forms. Review deployment and Request results use the existing host-approval workflow. Pause rehearsal and Advance rehearsal affect offline rehearsal only. Drawers collapse and Escape closes a visible panel outside text fields. Settings → Game Master stores this layout preference separately from the mission. The normal editor is restored by toggling GM workspace off; unapplied form values and catalog search remain intact."]=window.PlannerTranslations.fr["Open the GM tab in the right panel. Import a mission first, then Create rehearsal from this plan or Load scenario JSON. Resume enables Advance 10 seconds; time does not run automatically. Fire enabled scenario events, inspect objectives and reports, and view purple rehearsal markers. Export journal saves the run separately from your mission. Load journal requires the same mission. The replay slider previews a command revision; Return to GM restores the active run. Undo GM action reverses the last command while retaining its history. Reset is recorded and starts a fresh state. Editing the mission unloads the rehearsal. Recover saved rehearsal offers the last valid run after reopening, against the same mission. Export journal remains a portable backup. These controls do not send commands to Reforger."]+" Espace GM dans l’en-tête active la disposition compacte. Ressources ouvre le tiroir de recherche existant ; Inspecteur montre la sélection planifiée, ID, grille et GUID. Éditeur rétablit les formulaires. Vérifier le déploiement et Résultats des demandes conservent l’approbation dans le jeu. Pause et Avancer agissent uniquement sur la répétition hors ligne. Les panneaux se replient ; Échap les ferme hors des champs de texte. Paramètres → Game Master conserve la disposition séparément de la mission. Désactiver Espace GM restaure l’éditeur normal sans perdre les valeurs non appliquées ou la recherche.";

window.PlannerTranslations.de["Open the GM tab in the right panel. Import a mission first, then Create rehearsal from this plan or Load scenario JSON. Resume enables Advance 10 seconds; time does not run automatically. Fire enabled scenario events, inspect objectives and reports, and view purple rehearsal markers. Export journal saves the run separately from your mission. Load journal requires the same mission. The replay slider previews a command revision; Return to GM restores the active run. Undo GM action reverses the last command while retaining its history. Reset is recorded and starts a fresh state. Editing the mission unloads the rehearsal. Recover saved rehearsal offers the last valid run after reopening, against the same mission. Export journal remains a portable backup. These controls do not send commands to Reforger. GM workspace in the header enables the optional compact layout. Assets opens the existing searchable drawer; Inspector shows planned selection, ID, grid and GUID. Editor restores the existing forms. Review deployment and Request results use the existing host-approval workflow. Pause rehearsal and Advance rehearsal affect offline rehearsal only. Drawers collapse and Escape closes a visible panel outside text fields. Settings → Game Master stores this layout preference separately from the mission. The normal editor is restored by toggling GM workspace off; unapplied form values and catalog search remain intact."]=window.PlannerTranslations.de["Open the GM tab in the right panel. Import a mission first, then Create rehearsal from this plan or Load scenario JSON. Resume enables Advance 10 seconds; time does not run automatically. Fire enabled scenario events, inspect objectives and reports, and view purple rehearsal markers. Export journal saves the run separately from your mission. Load journal requires the same mission. The replay slider previews a command revision; Return to GM restores the active run. Undo GM action reverses the last command while retaining its history. Reset is recorded and starts a fresh state. Editing the mission unloads the rehearsal. Recover saved rehearsal offers the last valid run after reopening, against the same mission. Export journal remains a portable backup. These controls do not send commands to Reforger."]+" GM-Arbeitsbereich in der Kopfzeile aktiviert die kompakte Ansicht. Ressourcen öffnet die vorhandene Suche; Inspektor zeigt geplante Auswahl, ID, Raster und GUID. Editor öffnet die bestehenden Formulare. Deployment prüfen und Anfrageergebnisse behalten die Freigabe im Spiel bei. Pause und Fortsetzen wirken nur auf die Offline-Probe. Bereiche sind einklappbar; Escape schließt sie außerhalb von Textfeldern. Einstellungen → Game Master speichert das Layout getrennt von der Mission. Ausschalten stellt den normalen Editor wieder her; nicht angewendete Werte und Suche bleiben erhalten.";

window.PlannerTranslations.fr["In the GAME, open Host Pairing → Players / AI / factions. Enable factions and select units, then return to pairing. Paste this address and code and Connect. Uses host_1 through host_60 automatically. Requires COMMAND ORBAT Bridge 0.4.1 or later; Workshop 0.3.0 is insufficient."]="Dans le JEU, ouvrez l’appairage hôte → joueurs / IA / factions. Activez les factions et sélectionnez les unités, puis revenez à l’appairage. Collez l’adresse et le code, puis connectez. Les identifiants host_1 à host_60 sont automatiques. Nécessite COMMAND ORBAT Bridge 0.4.1 ou ultérieur ; Workshop 0.3.0 ne suffit pas.";

window.PlannerTranslations.de["In the GAME, open Host Pairing → Players / AI / factions. Enable factions and select units, then return to pairing. Paste this address and code and Connect. Uses host_1 through host_60 automatically. Requires COMMAND ORBAT Bridge 0.4.1 or later; Workshop 0.3.0 is insufficient."]="Im SPIEL Host-Kopplung → Spieler / KI / Fraktionen öffnen. Fraktionen aktivieren und Einheiten auswählen, dann zur Kopplung zurückkehren. Adresse und Code einfügen und verbinden. host_1 bis host_60 werden automatisch verwendet. Erfordert COMMAND ORBAT Bridge 0.4.1 oder neuer; Workshop 0.3.0 reicht nicht aus.";

Object.assign(window.PlannerTranslations.fr,{"Open offline GM panel": "Ouvrir le panneau GM hors ligne", "Open compact GM workspace": "Ouvrir l’espace GM compact"});
window.PlannerTranslations.fr["Open Settings → Game Master. Set local recovery, rehearsal overlay and zone visibility, marker-size slider, time step and default replay interval; click Save settings to apply. Cancel leaves the saved settings unchanged. Open offline GM panel takes you directly to the rehearsal panel. Disabling recovery stops new writes but keeps existing copies; Delete recovery in GM removes them. Saving settings stops replay without changing its journal. Reopening never starts a rehearsal automatically. These preferences are separate from mission JSON. Performance checks accompany rendering, playback and storage changes. Enable compact GM workspace is a separate layout preference: save settings to apply it, or use Open compact GM workspace. The layout switch does not start rehearsal or connect to the game."]=window.PlannerTranslations.fr["Open Settings → Game Master. Set local recovery, rehearsal overlay and zone visibility, marker-size slider, time step and default replay interval; click Save settings to apply. Cancel leaves the saved settings unchanged. Open GM workspace takes you directly to GM. Disabling recovery stops new writes but keeps existing copies; Delete recovery in GM removes them. Saving settings stops replay without changing its journal. Reopening never starts a rehearsal automatically. These preferences are separate from mission JSON. Performance checks accompany rendering, playback and storage changes."]+" La disposition compacte est distincte de la répétition : activez-la puis enregistrez les paramètres, ou utilisez Ouvrir l’espace GM compact. Ce changement ne démarre ni répétition ni connexion au jeu.";

Object.assign(window.PlannerTranslations.de,{"Open offline GM panel": "Offline-GM-Bereich öffnen", "Open compact GM workspace": "Kompakten GM-Arbeitsbereich öffnen"});
window.PlannerTranslations.de["Open Settings → Game Master. Set local recovery, rehearsal overlay and zone visibility, marker-size slider, time step and default replay interval; click Save settings to apply. Cancel leaves the saved settings unchanged. Open offline GM panel takes you directly to the rehearsal panel. Disabling recovery stops new writes but keeps existing copies; Delete recovery in GM removes them. Saving settings stops replay without changing its journal. Reopening never starts a rehearsal automatically. These preferences are separate from mission JSON. Performance checks accompany rendering, playback and storage changes. Enable compact GM workspace is a separate layout preference: save settings to apply it, or use Open compact GM workspace. The layout switch does not start rehearsal or connect to the game."]=window.PlannerTranslations.de["Open Settings → Game Master. Set local recovery, rehearsal overlay and zone visibility, marker-size slider, time step and default replay interval; click Save settings to apply. Cancel leaves the saved settings unchanged. Open GM workspace takes you directly to GM. Disabling recovery stops new writes but keeps existing copies; Delete recovery in GM removes them. Saving settings stops replay without changing its journal. Reopening never starts a rehearsal automatically. These preferences are separate from mission JSON. Performance checks accompany rendering, playback and storage changes."]+" Das kompakte Layout ist getrennt von der Probe: aktivieren und Einstellungen speichern oder Kompakten GM-Arbeitsbereich öffnen verwenden. Es startet weder Probe noch Spielverbindung.";

window.PlannerTranslations.fr["Changing rehearsal settings stops current replay playback; the active journal stays intact. Layout-only changes leave playback running."]="Modifier les paramètres de répétition arrête la lecture, sans perdre le journal actif. Les changements de disposition seuls laissent la lecture continuer.";

window.PlannerTranslations.de["Changing rehearsal settings stops current replay playback; the active journal stays intact. Layout-only changes leave playback running."]="Ändern der Probeeinstellungen stoppt die Wiedergabe; das aktive Journal bleibt erhalten. Reine Layoutänderungen lassen die Wiedergabe weiterlaufen.";

