window.PlannerTranslations.fr["Open Settings → Game Master. Set local recovery, rehearsal overlay and zone visibility, marker-size slider, time step and default replay interval; click Save settings to apply. Cancel leaves the saved settings unchanged. Open offline GM panel takes you directly to the rehearsal panel. Disabling recovery stops new writes but keeps existing copies; Delete recovery in GM removes them. Saving settings stops replay without changing its journal. Reopening never starts a rehearsal automatically. These preferences are separate from mission JSON. Performance checks accompany rendering, playback and storage changes. Enable compact GM workspace is a separate layout preference: save settings to apply it, or use Open compact GM workspace. The layout switch does not start rehearsal or connect to the game. In compact GM workspace, Assets, Inspector and Editor stay visible. Open GM actions for deployment review, native AI orders, request results and rehearsal controls. Escape closes that menu first."]=window.PlannerTranslations.fr["Open Settings → Game Master. Set local recovery, rehearsal overlay and zone visibility, marker-size slider, time step and default replay interval; click Save settings to apply. Cancel leaves the saved settings unchanged. Open offline GM panel takes you directly to the rehearsal panel. Disabling recovery stops new writes but keeps existing copies; Delete recovery in GM removes them. Saving settings stops replay without changing its journal. Reopening never starts a rehearsal automatically. These preferences are separate from mission JSON. Performance checks accompany rendering, playback and storage changes. Enable compact GM workspace is a separate layout preference: save settings to apply it, or use Open compact GM workspace. The layout switch does not start rehearsal or connect to the game."]+" Dans l’espace GM compact, Assets, Inspector et Editor restent visibles. Ouvrez Actions GM pour le déploiement, les ordres IA, les résultats et les répétitions. Échap ferme d’abord ce menu.";

window.PlannerTranslations.de["Open Settings → Game Master. Set local recovery, rehearsal overlay and zone visibility, marker-size slider, time step and default replay interval; click Save settings to apply. Cancel leaves the saved settings unchanged. Open offline GM panel takes you directly to the rehearsal panel. Disabling recovery stops new writes but keeps existing copies; Delete recovery in GM removes them. Saving settings stops replay without changing its journal. Reopening never starts a rehearsal automatically. These preferences are separate from mission JSON. Performance checks accompany rendering, playback and storage changes. Enable compact GM workspace is a separate layout preference: save settings to apply it, or use Open compact GM workspace. The layout switch does not start rehearsal or connect to the game. In compact GM workspace, Assets, Inspector and Editor stay visible. Open GM actions for deployment review, native AI orders, request results and rehearsal controls. Escape closes that menu first."]=window.PlannerTranslations.de["Open Settings → Game Master. Set local recovery, rehearsal overlay and zone visibility, marker-size slider, time step and default replay interval; click Save settings to apply. Cancel leaves the saved settings unchanged. Open offline GM panel takes you directly to the rehearsal panel. Disabling recovery stops new writes but keeps existing copies; Delete recovery in GM removes them. Saving settings stops replay without changing its journal. Reopening never starts a rehearsal automatically. These preferences are separate from mission JSON. Performance checks accompany rendering, playback and storage changes. Enable compact GM workspace is a separate layout preference: save settings to apply it, or use Open compact GM workspace. The layout switch does not start rehearsal or connect to the game."]+" Im kompakten GM-Arbeitsbereich bleiben Assets, Inspector und Editor sichtbar. GM-Aktionen öffnet Bereitstellungsprüfung, KI-Befehle, Ergebnisse und Probensteuerung. Escape schliesst zuerst dieses Menü.";

Object.assign(window.PlannerTranslations.fr,{"Inspect function names, registrations, calls and possible redefinitions. Name matches do not prove runtime bindings.": "Inspectez noms de fonctions, enregistrements, appels et redéfinitions possibles. Une correspondance de noms ne prouve pas une liaison à l’exécution.", "Choose sources for Function Explorer": "Choisir les sources pour l’explorateur de fonctions", "Cancel function inspection": "Annuler l’inspection des fonctions", "Search functions or source paths": "Rechercher fonctions ou chemins source", "Function rows": "Résultats de fonctions", "All function rows": "Tous les résultats de fonctions", "Function names": "Noms de fonctions", "Definitions and registrations": "Définitions et enregistrements", "Call candidates": "Appels candidats", "Function warnings": "Avertissements de fonctions", "Dynamic code and scope operations": "Code dynamique et opérations de portée", "Previous function rows": "Résultats de fonctions précédents", "Next function rows": "Résultats de fonctions suivants", "Clear function review": "Effacer la revue des fonctions", "No function review": "Aucune revue des fonctions", "Function name candidate": "Nom de fonction candidat", "writes": "écritures", "registrations": "enregistrements", "calls": "appels", "possible writes": "écritures possibles", "Possible function write": "Écriture de fonction possible", "Function registration candidate": "Enregistrement de fonction candidat", "Call candidate": "Appel candidat", "Unresolved call target": "Cible d’appel non résolue", "Dynamic or scope operation": "Opération dynamique ou de portée", "Show matching rows": "Afficher les résultats correspondants", "Function inspection requires the desktop app": "L’inspection des fonctions nécessite l’application de bureau", "function name candidates": "noms de fonctions candidats", "names requiring review": "noms à examiner", "Inspecting function candidates": "Inspection des fonctions candidates", "Function review ready": "Revue des fonctions prête", "Function inspection cancelled": "Inspection des fonctions annulée", "Function inspection rejected": "Inspection des fonctions refusée", "Source diagnostics": "Diagnostics source", "Close diagnostics": "Fermer les diagnostics", "Dependencies": "Dépendances", "Functions": "Fonctions", "Open source diagnostics": "Ouvrir les diagnostics source", "Open Function Explorer": "Ouvrir l’explorateur de fonctions", "Function Explorer": "Explorateur de fonctions", "Assets → Arma 3 migration review → Open source diagnostics → Functions. Choose sources for Function Explorer accepts selected loose files or a source-package JSON with files and mounts, plus optional configRoots. Search function names or source paths; filter definitions, calls, warnings or dynamic operations. View source shows captured lines; Show matching rows filters by the selected name. Names, writes and registrations are candidates, not verified runtime bindings. Missing config roots and unknown load order remain review warnings. Cancel or rejection retains the prior review. Switching tabs or language preserves it; Clear function review removes only this session view. Settings provides Open Function Explorer. Nothing edits your mission, executes SQF or generates Enforce code.": "Assets → Revue de migration Arma 3 → Ouvrir les diagnostics source → Fonctions. Sélectionnez les fichiers source ou un paquet JSON avec files et mounts, et configRoots facultatif. Recherchez noms ou chemins et filtrez définitions, appels, avertissements ou opérations dynamiques. Voir la source montre les lignes capturées ; Afficher les résultats correspondants filtre par nom. Les noms, écritures et enregistrements sont des candidats, pas des liaisons prouvées. Racines absentes et ordre de chargement inconnu restent à examiner. Annulation ou refus conserve la revue ; onglets et langue conservent le contexte. Effacer ne retire que cette vue de session. Également accessible dans les paramètres. Aucune modification de mission, exécution SQF ou génération Enforce."});

