Object.assign(window.PlannerTranslations.fr,{"Initialization paths (advisory)": "Chemins d’initialisation (indicatifs)", "Checks supported literal-write paths and branch merges. Unknown calls, loop execution, caller bindings and native types remain manual.": "Vérifie les écritures littérales prises en charge et les fusions de branches. Appels inconnus, boucles, liaisons d’appel et types natifs restent manuels.", "Refresh initialization context": "Actualiser le contexte d’initialisation", "Analyze initialization paths": "Analyser les chemins d’initialisation", "Initialization rows": "Lignes d’initialisation", "Possible uninitialized locals": "Variables locales possiblement non initialisées", "All reviewed reads": "Toutes les lectures analysées", "Manual effect barriers": "Effets nécessitant une revue manuelle", "Initialization review is stale": "L’analyse d’initialisation est obsolète", "Initialization analysis failed": "Échec de l’analyse d’initialisation", "Analyzing initialization paths": "Analyse des chemins d’initialisation", "Initialization path review ready": "Analyse des chemins d’initialisation prête", "possible uninitialized reads": "lectures possiblement non initialisées", "supported write paths": "chemins d’écriture pris en charge", "possibly-uninitialized": "initialisation possible manquante", "written-on-all-reviewed-paths": "écriture sur tous les chemins analysés", "binding-unresolved": "liaison non résolue", "entry-value-unresolved": "valeur d’entrée non résolue"});

Object.assign(window.PlannerTranslations.de,{"Initialization paths (advisory)": "Initialisierungspfade (Hinweise)", "Checks supported literal-write paths and branch merges. Unknown calls, loop execution, caller bindings and native types remain manual.": "Prüft unterstützte Literalzuweisungen und Verzweigungszusammenführungen. Unbekannte Aufrufe, Schleifenausführung, Aufrufbindungen und native Typen bleiben manuell.", "Refresh initialization context": "Initialisierungskontext aktualisieren", "Analyze initialization paths": "Initialisierungspfade analysieren", "Initialization rows": "Initialisierungszeilen", "Possible uninitialized locals": "Möglicherweise uninitialisierte lokale Variablen", "All reviewed reads": "Alle geprüften Lesezugriffe", "Manual effect barriers": "Manuell zu prüfende Effektbarrieren", "Initialization review is stale": "Initialisierungsprüfung ist veraltet", "Initialization analysis failed": "Initialisierungsanalyse fehlgeschlagen", "Analyzing initialization paths": "Initialisierungspfade werden analysiert", "Initialization path review ready": "Initialisierungspfadprüfung bereit", "possible uninitialized reads": "möglicherweise uninitialisierte Lesezugriffe", "supported write paths": "unterstützte Zuweisungspfade", "possibly-uninitialized": "möglicherweise uninitialisiert", "written-on-all-reviewed-paths": "auf allen geprüften Pfaden zugewiesen", "binding-unresolved": "Bindung ungeklärt", "entry-value-unresolved": "Eingangswert ungeklärt"});

